# Netlify redirects - TanyaHicks.com
#
# BOOK 1 IDENTITY (2026-08-27). The foundational person-facing book is now
#   FREE 2B ME: Less fixing. More living.
# canonical at /books/free-2b-me/. Every historical route for that book resolves
# there in ONE hop.
#
# One hop matters. /enough/* and /books/enough/ previously pointed at
# /books/it-shouldnt-be-this-hard/. Leaving them alone and adding a further
# redirect from the old slug would have built a chain
#   /enough/* -> old slug -> new slug
# which leaks link equity and slows every historical inbound link. They are
# repointed straight at the canonical route instead.
#
# The trailing "!" forces the redirect even though the historical page files still
# exist on disk. That is deliberate: the source is PRESERVED in the repository for
# provenance while the public route resolves to the current book.

/books/it-shouldnt-be-this-hard/*  /books/free-2b-me/  301!
/books/book-1/*                    /books/free-2b-me/  301!
/books/enough/*                    /books/free-2b-me/  301!
/enough/*                          /books/free-2b-me/  301!
/designed-for-more/*               /books/free-2b-me/  301!
